    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi kengila Joamon kodi Josiria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma hongo moro, Nahas kere ma Amon otho, aka wode m'ilwoŋo ni Hanun ama olunjo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kere Daudi waco ni, “Ripo anyuthi mere ri Hanun paka bamere Nahas ndir no otimo ran.” Ameno Daudi ooro jomikwenda bongi Hanun kisekera go ro tho pa bamere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jomikwenda no jotundo Amon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jomic rieko pa Hanun jowaco rigo ni, “Iparo adieri ni Daudi ooro jomikwenda me kisekera in ma woro benin? Daudi ooro jomikwenda pere me bino ŋeyo nyaliŋliŋ ma tindi madwoŋ me ŋey wonyali mako!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanun omako jomikwenda pa Daudi aka olielo adec ye tik gin, oyeco nangin pajo, to riemo jo woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wickwot omako jomikwenda me dok peco. Aka munyo Daudi owinjo gim'otimere rijo, odhiro rijo wac nike jowobedi Yeriko cuka ye tik gin twi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Joamon joneno nike joloko Daudi jakwor pajo, joculo kilo 34,000 ma feza kipangisa cawilin kodi jogwey wok i Mesopotamia ma malo kodi wok iy'adec ma Maka kodi Zoba i Siria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cawilin 32,000 ma jopangisa kodi jolweny pa kere ma Maka jobino aka joketho kambi cegin gi Medeba. Joamon bende jobino wok i tindin pajo madongo to joyikere lweny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Daudi owinjo, ooro Yowab kodi jolweny pere gibe lweny gi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joamon joŋanjo, aka jocanere i dhiot ma waŋkac ma Raba, aka kerin m'oyido jobino konyo jo oyido jonitie kakendi gin kam'othangere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yowab oneno nike jolweny oyido jonyalo monjo go gi yuwiye kiri gi yucen, oyero jolweny mabeyo kwoŋ jolweny pa Isiraili, aka oketho jo kam'oŋiyere gi Josiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolweny m'odoŋ Yowab oketho jo i cingi Abisay omin go; aka oketho jo kam'oŋiyere gi Joamon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowab owaco ri Abisay ni, “K'ineno ni Josiria jokengila an, ibin ikonyan; to k'aneno ni Joamon jokengila in alabino konyin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedi jamiseni! Weyi walweny matek ri ji mawan aka ri tindin madongo pa Were mawan. Aka weyi mito pa Rwoth wotimere!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowab gi cwo pere jodhire cegin monjo Josiria, to Josiria joringo woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Joamon joneno Josiria joringo woko, jo bende joringo woko kwoŋ Abisay aka jogik i tindi madwoŋ. Kenyo Yowab oweyo lweny gi Joamon, aka odok Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To munyo Josiria joneno nike Joisiraili jokengila jo, jokelo jolweny ma jowok iy'adec ma Siria kodi yuwok ceŋ ma malawa Yufrete, aka joketho jo i cingi Sobak, jamituka jolweny pa kere Hadadeza ma Zoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Daudi owinjo, ocoko jolweny ma Isiraili je kanyacel, aka joŋado malawa Yordan to jobino Helam kama Josiria oyido jocanere iye to joŋiyere gi jo. Lweny ocakere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka Joisiraili joriemo woko Josiria. Daudi kodi cwo pere joneko cwo ma Siria 7,000 ma jogweyo cawila, kodi cwo 40,000 ma jor'atiendi, aka jowumiya Sobak jamituka jolweny pa Hadadeza, to tho kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo kerin m'oyido jobedo ŋecin pa Hadadeza joneno nike Joisiraili jokengila jo, jotimo siem gi Joisiraili, aka jolokere ŋecin pajo. Aka Josiria lworo omako jo konyo Joamon kendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
